        <body>
            <div xml:id="d673">

                <pb facs="0608" n="532" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg532"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/18009</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Blocker to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eagle Pass</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Telegram just received from General Obregon at Chihuahua, when translated,
                    states: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Please inform your Government I will confer with General Scott at Juarez.
                            Am leaving for there to-morrow.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>General Scott advised.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blocker</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
